OL,3,AIndonesia volcano eruption leaves
OL,4,A270,000 stranded as airports extend
OL,5,Aclosure
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome 270,000 passengers have been left
OL,8,Fstranded across Indonesia after a
OL,9,Fvolcanic eruption grounded more than
OL,10,F2,000 flights and forced airports to
OL,11,Fsuspend operations for a second day.
OL,13,FAnak Krakatau, located 150km (90mi)
OL,14,Ffrom Jakarta, began erupting late on
OL,15,FFriday, producing lava fountains and
OL,16,Fsending volcanic ash into the capital
OL,17,Fand the Lampung province. It stayed
OL,18,Fseismically active throughout the
OL,19,Fweekend.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
