OL,3,AIndonesia volcano eruption leaves
OL,4,A270,000 stranded as airports extend
OL,5,Aclosure
OL,6,
OL,7,FJakarta's Soekarno-Hatta International
OL,8,Fdecided not to reopen at 18:00 (11:00
OL,9,FGMT) as planned due to the continued
OL,10,Fpresence of volcanic ash near its
OL,11,Fairspace.
OL,13,FA press release from the airport said
OL,14,Fflights would now resume at 23:59 on
OL,15,FMonday.
